--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4df0014cb02a0cf4bbbc7addabd2224a, type: 3}
  m_Name: MainDialogue1NPC1NG+
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - speakerName: Pig
    text: Wassup homie, you seem lost.
  - speakerName: Pig
    text: And...weak, honestly.
  - speakerName: Pig
    text: What? Don't give me that face homie, do you even know where you are?
  - speakerName: Pig
    text: "Bro, you don't even have a\u2014what the fuck? How the hell do you have
      that sword? Wait a sec, where is...how...? Well, shit. I don't have the slightest
      clue what's going on, but this saves me some time anyway.     "
  - speakerName: Pig
    text: Since you have that sword, you certainly know it is magical, right? It
      absorbs certain components to make you stronger. Use it right and maybe you'll
      stop being such a weakling. Now for your lack of wits...I'm afraid that's beyond
      me.
  - speakerName: Pig
    text: Also, you definitely know you should keep an eye out for the purple orbs
      enemies drop, they might come in handy.
  - speakerName: Pig
    text: 'Now, there are some slimes over there, weakly bastards but if you touch
      ''em won''t feel nice. Go kill them and absorb their components!!! '
  - speakerName: Pig
    text: 'By the way, "I" opens your inventory and crafting table, "J" uses the
      sword, and mouse interacts with inventory and some other things. '
  - speakerName: Pig
    text: Not that I know what this "I", "J" or "mouse" mean or anything I don't
      know why I said that honestly.
  - speakerName: Pig
    text: Aight good luck!!!
